---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="section-content">
		<section id="home-panel" data-section-panel="home">
			<article class="home-page">
				<header class="home-intro">
					<h1>Hi, I’m Yichen.</h1>
					<p>I’m a first-year CS undergrad at the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign.</p>
				</header>

				<section class="home-section">
					<div class="home-copy">
						<p>
							I’ve been coding since high school, but my passion for the field only really ignited
							the summer after 11th grade.
						</p>
						<p>
							In this time, I’ve gone through several deep-dives into topics that momentarily
							sparked my interest. Although I have a tendency to drop projects that no longer seem
							novel, I have accumulated several narrow interests over many investment cycles.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="home-section">
					<div class="home-copy">
						<p>
							I am fascinated by AI, its applications, and its development. I am also a fan of
							robotics, no doubt influenced by my time on my high school’s FRC team.
						</p>
						<p>
							Together, these curiosities have nudged me in the direction of{' '}
							<em>robotic and agentic swarm intelligence</em>,{' '}
							<em>distributed cognition</em>, and{' '}
							<em>emergent collaborative tendencies of artificial life forms</em>.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="home-section">
					<div class="home-copy">
						<p>
							The most direct application of these concepts is in my project{' '}
							<em>Emergent World</em>. It is a culmination of multiple attempts at simulating
							swarm intelligence with naive heuristics and pathfinding algorithms—ant-colony
							optimization and Dijkstra’s algorithm—and now uses neural networks trained on data
							collected from a custom-written environment.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="home-section">
					<div class="home-copy">
						<p>
							On the side, I’ve also been exploring tools and applications for{' '}
							<a href="https://powerline.io">powerline.io</a>,{' '}my favorite browser game, which
							I have been playing for more than six years. A Mac keybinder that emulates the
							mobile application can be found on my{' '}
							<a href="https://github.com/Soapsws">GitHub</a>.
						</p>
						<p>
							More recently, I have been planning an AI agent that can play the game better than
							built-in bots using local algorithms.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="home-section">
					<div class="home-copy">
						<p>
							It’s my first semester at UIUC, and I am excited to engage with the many
							opportunities it offers.
						</p>
						<p class="editorial-note">TBD — conditional projects</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="home-section">
					<div class="home-copy">
						<p>
							I also enjoy creative writing. I have spent many years worldbuilding, tracing back
							to elementary school. However, it is only recently that I gained the literary tools,
							time, and confidence to put my ideas onto paper.
						</p>
						<p>
							I’m currently working on the world of the upcoming webnovel{' '}
							<em>Nameless Harvestman</em>. You can also read some of my personal ramblings and
							thoughts in the personal essays section.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>
			</article>
		</section>

		<section
			id="personal-panel"
			data-section-panel="personal"
			hidden
		>
			<h1>Personal technical projects</h1>
		</section>

		<section
			id="uiuc-panel"
			data-section-panel="uiuc"
			hidden
		>
			<h1>UIUC-related technical projects</h1>
		</section>

		<section
			id="creative-panel"
			data-section-panel="creative"
			hidden
		>
			<h1>Creative projects</h1>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.section-content {
		width: min(76rem, calc(100% - 2.6rem));
		margin: 4rem auto 6rem;
	}

	.home-page {
		display: grid;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.home-intro {
		max-width: 46rem;
	}

	.home-intro h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}

	.home-intro p {
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		color: #aaa7a0;
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.home-section {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 44rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}

	.home-copy {
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem);
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.home-copy p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.home-copy p + p {
		margin-top: 1.3rem;
	}

	.home-copy a {
		color: #9dbbd1;
		text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.editorial-note {
		color: #777980;
		font-size: 0.8em;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	/* Future images can be inserted as a direct child of any .home-section using this class. */
	.home-section :global(.media-block) {
		grid-column: 2;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.home-section :global(.media-block img) {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.section-content {
			margin-top: 2.5rem;
		}

		.home-page {
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.home-section {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.home-section :global(.media-block) {
			grid-column: 1;
		}
	}
</style>
